WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.043 --> 00:00:10.831
Polly and Jack are coming.

2
00:00:10.832 --> 00:00:23.557
I'm going to teach them something new today.

3
00:00:23.558 --> 00:00:30.434
Omar: Hi, Polly. Hi,

4
00:00:30.435 --> 00:00:34.902
Jack. Polly: What are we doing

5
00:00:34.903 --> 00:00:40.138
today? Omar: I'm going to teach you how to

6
00:00:40.139 --> 00:00:44.611
sew. You can make a picnic blanket.

7
00:00:44.612 --> 00:00:47.953
Polly: What do we do?

8
00:00:47.954 --> 00:01:05.974
Omar: I'll show

9
00:01:05.975 --> 00:01:11.077
you. Polly: This is

10
00:01:11.078 --> 00:01:26.517
fun. Jack: Yes. Everyone will like this picnic

11
00:01:26.518 --> 00:01:31.094
blanket. Jack: There's a little

12
00:01:31.095 --> 00:01:34.678
girl. Are you okay?

13
00:01:34.679 --> 00:01:37.949
Red: My name is Little Red.

14
00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.555
I was bringing food to my sick grandmother.

15
00:01:41.556 --> 00:01:49.656
But I fell and hurt my foot. Jack:

16
00:01:49.657 --> 00:01:52.731
You should go home and rest. Red:

17
00:01:52.732 --> 00:01:56.457
But what about Granny? Jack:

18
00:01:56.458 --> 00:01:58.713
