26
00:03:03.799 --> 00:03:09.672
Wolf: That's nice.

27
00:03:09.673 --> 00:03:17.134
But Granny's house is down that long path.

28
00:03:17.135 --> 00:03:20.397
Polly: Oh! Thanks for telling us!

29
00:03:20.398 --> 00:03:40.914
Jack: Let's hurry. Granny must be hungry.

